			"contents": "@PROGETTO@GE@FILE\n   Note\n      progetto di gestione dei file e delle cartelle con le API\n      WINDOWS\n\n\nPARAMETRI_VBA\n   Note\n      per gestire al meglio vba e Access 2011 ho creato una variabile di sistema che identifica\n      Access 2011 denominata come VARIABILE DI SISTEMA = \"ACCESS_2011\"\n\n      VARIABILE DI AMBIENTE ACCESS CASA\n         Per casa la path PER L'ESEGUIBILE DI ACCESS E PER LA COSTRUZIONE DELLA VARIABILE DI AMBIENTE è la seguente :\n            variabile denominata: \"ACCESS_2011\" = C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\root\\Office16\\MSACCESS.EXE\n\n      VARIABILE DI AMBIENTE ACCESS UFFICIO\n            variabile denominata: \"ACCESS_2011\" = C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\root\\Office16\\MSACCESS.EXE\n\n\n\nDALLA FORM GE_FILE AD UNA CLASSE\n\n   ho costruito una form denominata Msys_GEFILE_Frm01_GESTIONI in vba che utilizza le api windows per gestire i file. Mi sono accorto pero che è difficie far dialogare questa form con altre form soprattuto con l'utilizzo delle funzioni api per gestire i file.\n   Quindi vorrei spostare tutte le funzioni di utilizzo delle api \n   windows in una classe che restera a servizio di tutte le form\n   o i moduli che vorranno utilizzare le sue funzioni.\n   La classe che ho creato si chiama Msys_GEFILE_CLS01_GESTIONI.\n   le form come la presente utilizzera queste classe per la \n   gestione dei file con le api windows secondo questo schema\n\n   La form Msys_GEFILE_Frm01_GESTIONI <----> classe Msys_GEFILE_CLS01_GESTIONI\n\n   Questa è la intestazione delle proprieta  della classe sono le seguenti e poi inviero le altre funzioni, secondo te questo progetto si puo fare è valido?\n\n   '//@CLASSE@GESTIONE_( DEI FILE MEDIANTE LE API WINDOWS, nome della classe Msys_GEFILE_CLS01_GESTIONI)\n\n'Variabili di database\n'>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>:>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>\n\n'DAO\nDim DaoDB As DAO.Database           '//occorre il riferimento alla libreria  Microsoft DAO 3.6 Object Libray\nDim DaoWks As DAO.Workspace\nDim DaoRs As DAO.Recordset\n\n\n'ADO\nDim ADODB As Database\nDim AdodaoRs As Recordset\n\n'record di lettura\nDim DaoRs_Lett As DAO.Recordset\nDim Lng_id_Lett As Long\n\n'record da cancellare\nDim DaoRs_Canc As DAO.Recordset\n\n'record oggetti\nDim DaoRs_Oggetti As DAO.Recordset\nDim vV1_Oggetti As Variant\n\nDim Ctr_Label As Label\nDim Ctr_TextBox As TextBox\nDim ctr As Controls\n\nDim objx_Forms As AllForms\nDim objx_Form As Form\nDim ix_Count_Control As Integer\n\nDim obj As AccessObject\nDim obj_Oggetto As AccessObject\nDim Dbs As Object\n\n\n\n\n\n'Contatori\nDim iCount As Integer\nDim dbl_count As Double\n\n'Le variabili generiche\nDim sSql As String                                          '//Stringa di estrazione SQL\n\n'Variabili generali\nDim Str1 As String\nDim Int1 As Integer\nDim Lng1 As Long\nDim Dbl1 As Double\nDim Bln1 As Boolean\nDim Vv1 As Variant\nDim obj1 As Object\n\n\n'//variabili del gestione del file\n'//...............................................//\n    \n    '//Path e file selezionato\n    Dim result As Variant\n    '//dim percorso per la casella di testo\n    Dim percorso As Variant\n    \n     ' Variabile per il percorso del file selezionato\n    Dim filePath As String\n    \n    ' Crea una nuova istanza di FileDialog (per aprire un file)\n    Dim fileDialog As Object\n    \n    ' comando shell\n    Dim officePath As String\n    Dim command As String\n    \n'//...............................................//\n\n\n'Variabili dei parametri\n'>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>:>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>\n\n'//API WINDOWS PER APRIRE LA GESTIONE DEI FILE\n\n' -- API per mostrare la finestra standard di selezione file (GetOpenFileName)\n#If VBA7 Then\n    Private Declare PtrSafe Function GetOpenFileNameA Lib \"comdlg32.dll\" (pOpenfilename As OPENFILENAME) As Long\n#Else\n    Private Declare Function GetOpenFileNameA Lib \"comdlg32.dll\" (pOpenfilename As OPENFILENAME) As Long\n#End If\n\n' -- Costanti per il comportamento della finestra di dialogo\nPrivate Const OFN_FILEMUSTEXIST = &H1000\nPrivate Const OFN_PATHMUSTEXIST = &H800\nPrivate Const OFN_ALLOWMULTISELECT = &H200\nPrivate Const OFN_EXPLORER = &H80000\n\n' -- Struttura necessaria per l'API GetOpenFileNameA\n#If VBA7 Then\n    Private Type OPENFILENAME\n        lStructSize As Long\n        hwndOwner As LongPtr\n        hInstance As LongPtr\n        lpstrFilter As String\n        lpstrCustomFilter As String\n        nMaxCustFilter As Long\n        nFilterIndex As Long\n        lpstrFile As String\n        nMaxFile As Long\n        lpstrFileTitle As String\n        nMaxFileTitle As Long\n        lpstrInitialDir As String\n        lpstrTitle As String\n        flags As Long\n        nFileOffset As Integer\n        nFileExtension As Integer\n        lpstrDefExt As String\n        lCustData As LongPtr\n        lpfnHook As LongPtr\n        lpTemplateName As String\n    End Type\n#Else\n    Private Type OPENFILENAME\n        lStructSize As Long\n        hwndOwner As Long\n        hInstance As Long\n        lpstrFilter As String\n        lpstrCustomFilter As String\n        nMaxCustFilter As Long\n        nFilterIndex As Long\n        lpstrFile As String\n        nMaxFile As Long\n        lpstrFileTitle As String\n        nMaxFileTitle As Long\n        lpstrInitialDir As String\n        lpstrTitle As String\n        flags As Long\n        nFileOffset As Integer\n        nFileExtension As Integer\n        lpstrDefExt As String\n        lCustData As Long\n        lpfnHook As Long\n        lpTemplateName As String\n    End Type\n\n\n#End If\n\n'//API WINDOWS PER UTILIZZARE LA SHELL 32\n'//dichiarazione access 20219 per la shell di windows\n#If VBA7 Then\n    Private Declare PtrSafe Function ShellExecute Lib \"shell32.dll\" Alias \"ShellExecuteA\" ( _\n        ByVal hwnd As LongPtr, _\n        ByVal lpOperation As String, _\n        ByVal lpFile As String, _\n        ByVal lpParameters As String, _\n        ByVal lpDirectory As String, _\n        ByVal nShowCmd As Long) As LongPtr\n#Else\n    Private Declare Function ShellExecute Lib \"shell32.dll\" Alias \"ShellExecuteA\" ( _\n        ByVal hwnd As Long, _\n        ByVal lpOperation As String, _\n        ByVal lpFile As String, _\n        ByVal lpParameters As String, _\n        ByVal lpDirectory As String, _\n        ByVal nShowCmd As Long) As Long\n#End If\n\n\n\n\n",
